# One Shot Bitcoin: the exact version of every piece.
#
# Each image is pinned by digest (the part after @sha256:), so what you install
# is byte for byte what was tested, whatever happens to the tag later.
# `./oneshot update` shows you the difference between the copy you are running
# and this file before it changes anything.

